{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-38439","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-42063","text":"FleetPrompt — Implementation Build Prompt"}]},{"id":"blk-38440","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42064","marks":["bold"],"text":"Version:"},{"id":"spn-42065","text":" 1.0 | "},{"id":"spn-42066","marks":["bold"],"text":"Date:"},{"id":"spn-42067","text":" April 2026 | "},{"id":"spn-42068","marks":["bold"],"text":"Type:"},{"id":"spn-42069","text":" Full Implementation (Phoenix + OTP + Supabase)"}]},{"id":"blk-38441","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42070","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-38442","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-42071","text":"Your Mission"}]},{"id":"blk-38443","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42072","text":"You are building "},{"id":"spn-42073","marks":["bold"],"text":"FleetPrompt"},{"id":"spn-42074","text":" — the open agent marketplace for the [&] Protocol ecosystem. FleetPrompt is the registry where production-ready AI agents are published, discovered, and deployed in one click. Every listed agent carries a versioned manifest, a computed trust score, declared permissions, and a linked SpecPrompt spec."}]},{"id":"blk-38444","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42075","marks":["bold"],"text":"Read `docs/spec/README.md` fully before writing a single line."},{"id":"spn-42076","text":" It is the authoritative spec."}]},{"id":"blk-38445","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42077","text":"FleetPrompt is the "},{"id":"spn-42078","marks":["bold"],"text":"distribution layer"},{"id":"spn-42079","text":" of the dark factory pipeline:"}]},{"id":"blk-38446","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"SpecPrompt (spec in) → Agentelic (build) → OS-008 (enforce) → FleetPrompt (distribute) → RuneFort (observe)"},{"id":"blk-38447","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42080","text":"FleetPrompt is also the "},{"id":"spn-42081","marks":["bold"],"text":"canonical trust broker"},{"id":"spn-42082","text":" of the [&] ecosystem — it aggregates PRISM CL scores, test coverage, usage data, and audit quality into a single trust score."}]},{"id":"blk-38448","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42083","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-38449","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-42084","text":"Target Stack"}]},{"id":"blk-38450","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Language:     Elixir 1.17+ / OTP 27\nFramework:    Phoenix 1.8+ (LiveView for real-time search, PubSub for trust broadcasts)\nDatabase:     PostgreSQL via shared Supabase (fleet.* schema, migration range 030-039)\nSearch:       pg_trgm + ts_vector (no external search infra)\nHot Cache:    ETS (:fp_manifests, :fp_trust_scores, :fp_search_index, :fp_categories)\nAudit:        Broadway pipeline (batched, append-only)\nBackground:   Oban (trust recompute, webhook delivery, search index refresh)\nAuth:         Supabase Auth (shared [&] ecosystem — amp.profiles, amp.workspaces)\nTelemetry:    :telemetry + Prometheus\nDeploy:       Mix release + Docker on Fly.io"},{"id":"blk-38451","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42085","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-38452","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-42086","text":"Repository Structure"}]},{"id":"blk-38453","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42087","text":"Create this structure inside "},{"id":"spn-42088","marks":["code"],"text":"fleetprompt.com/"},{"id":"spn-42089","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-38454","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"fleetprompt.com/\n├── lib/\n│   ├── fleet_prompt/\n│   │   ├── agents/\n│   │   │   └── agent.ex               # FleetPrompt.Agents.Agent schema (fleet.agents)\n│   │   ├── manifests/\n│   │   │   └── manifest.ex            # FleetPrompt.Manifests.Manifest schema (fleet.manifests)\n│   │   ├── publishers/\n│   │   │   └── publisher.ex           # FleetPrompt.Publishers.Publisher schema (fleet.publishers)\n│   │   ├── installs/\n│   │   │   └── install.ex             # FleetPrompt.Installs.Install schema (fleet.installs)\n│   │   ├── trust/\n│   │   │   ├── engine.ex              # FleetPrompt.TrustEngine — 4-signal score computation\n│   │   │   ├── worker.ex              # FleetPrompt.TrustWorker — GenServer per agent\n│   │   │   └── supervisor.ex          # FleetPrompt.TrustSupervisor — DynamicSupervisor\n│   │   ├── registry.ex                # FleetPrompt.Registry — manifest CRUD, version management\n│   │   ├── search/\n│   │   │   ├── index.ex               # FleetPrompt.SearchIndex — pg_trgm + ts_vector management\n│   │   │   └── query.ex               # FleetPrompt.Search — search query builder\n│   │   ├── forks.ex                   # FleetPrompt.Forks — fork-and-customize workflow\n│   │   ├── install_engine.ex          # FleetPrompt.InstallEngine — deploy orchestration\n│   │   ├── audit_writer.ex            # FleetPrompt.AuditWriter — Broadway append-only audit\n│   │   ├── webhook_dispatcher.ex      # FleetPrompt.WebhookDispatcher — Oban async webhooks\n│   │   ├── pipeline_intake.ex         # FleetPrompt.PipelineIntake — dark factory event handler\n│   │   └── mcp/\n│   │       ├── server.ex              # MCP JSON-RPC server (section 11)\n│   │       └── tools.ex               # Tool definitions and handlers\n│   ├── fleet_prompt.ex                # Application entry point\n│   └── fleet_prompt_web/\n│       ├── router.ex                  # Phoenix router\n│       ├── live/\n│       │   ├── search_live.ex         # LiveView — agent search (⌘K)\n│       │   ├── agent_detail_live.ex   # LiveView — agent detail + manifest\n│       │   ├── trust_dashboard_live.ex # LiveView — trust score dashboard\n│       │   └── publisher_live.ex      # LiveView — publisher profile\n│       └── controllers/\n│           ├── api_controller.ex      # REST API for programmatic access\n│           └── webhook_controller.ex  # POST /api/pipeline/intake (CloudEvents)\n├── test/\n│   ├── trust/\n│   │   ├── engine_test.exs\n│   │   └── worker_test.exs\n│   ├── search/\n│   │   ├── index_test.exs\n│   │   └── query_test.exs\n│   ├── pipeline_intake_test.exs\n│   ├── forks_test.exs\n│   └── fixtures/\n│       ├── customer_support_manifest.json\n│       └── consolidation_event.json\n├── mix.exs\n├── Dockerfile\n└── fly.toml"},{"id":"blk-38455","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42090","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-38456","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-42091","text":"Implementation Order"}]},{"id":"blk-38457","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-42092","text":"Phase 1: Core Registry (weeks 1-6)"}]},{"id":"blk-38458","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42093","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-42094","marks":["bold"],"text":"Set up Phoenix project"},{"id":"spn-42095","text":" with Ecto, Supabase config, LiveView 2. "},{"id":"spn-42096","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement Ecto schemas"},{"id":"spn-42097","text":" (sections 3-4)"}]},{"id":"blk-38459","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38461","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42098","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Publishers.Publisher"},{"id":"spn-42099","text":" with workspace_id, user_id (Supabase Auth)"}]}],"id":"blk-38460","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38463","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42100","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Agents.Agent"},{"id":"spn-42101","text":" with workspace_id, search_vector"}]}],"id":"blk-38462","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38465","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42102","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Manifests.Manifest"},{"id":"spn-42103","text":" with all fields from section 4.1"}]}],"id":"blk-38464","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38467","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42104","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Installs.Install"},{"id":"spn-42105","text":" with workspace_id"}]}],"id":"blk-38466","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38469","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42106","text":"Audit events schema with workspace_id"}]}],"id":"blk-38468","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-38470","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42107","text":"3. "},{"id":"spn-42108","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement Registry"},{"id":"spn-42109","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-42110","marks":["code"],"text":"registry.ex"},{"id":"spn-42111","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-38471","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38473","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42112","text":"Manifest CRUD with version immutability"}]}],"id":"blk-38472","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38475","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42113","text":"Version management (semver enforcement)"}]}],"id":"blk-38474","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38477","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42114","text":"Status transitions: draft → published → deprecated → yanked"}]}],"id":"blk-38476","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-38478","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42115","text":"4. "},{"id":"spn-42116","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement ETS caches"}]},{"id":"blk-38479","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38481","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42117","marks":["code"],"text":":fp_manifests"},{"id":"spn-42118","text":" — agent_id:version → manifest map"}]}],"id":"blk-38480","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38483","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42119","marks":["code"],"text":":fp_trust_scores"},{"id":"spn-42120","text":" — agent_id → {score, computed_at}"}]}],"id":"blk-38482","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38485","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42121","marks":["code"],"text":":fp_search_index"},{"id":"spn-42122","text":" — trigram → [agent_id]"}]}],"id":"blk-38484","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38487","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42123","marks":["code"],"text":":fp_categories"},{"id":"spn-42124","text":" — category_slug → [agent_id]"}]}],"id":"blk-38486","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-38488","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-42125","text":"Phase 2: Trust Engine (weeks 4-8)"}]},{"id":"blk-38489","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42126","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-42127","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement TrustEngine"},{"id":"spn-42128","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-42129","marks":["code"],"text":"trust/engine.ex"},{"id":"spn-42130","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-38490","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38492","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42131","text":"4 weighted signals: test_coverage (30%), spec_compliance (25%), usage_history (25%), audit_quality (20%)"}]}],"id":"blk-38491","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38494","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42132","marks":["code"],"text":"compute/1"},{"id":"spn-42133","text":" → integer 0-100"}]}],"id":"blk-38493","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38496","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42134","text":"Individual signal computations from section 5.1"}]}],"id":"blk-38495","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-38497","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42135","text":"2. "},{"id":"spn-42136","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement TrustWorker"},{"id":"spn-42137","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-42138","marks":["code"],"text":"trust/worker.ex"},{"id":"spn-42139","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-38498","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38500","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42140","text":"GenServer per agent"}]}],"id":"blk-38499","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38502","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42141","text":"Computes initial score on publish"}]}],"id":"blk-38501","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38504","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42142","text":"Recomputes on new data (installs, test results, audits)"}]}],"id":"blk-38503","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38506","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42143","text":"Caches in ETS"}]}],"id":"blk-38505","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38508","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42144","text":"Broadcasts via PubSub"}]}],"id":"blk-38507","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38510","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42145","text":"Hibernates after 5 minutes inactivity"}]}],"id":"blk-38509","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-38511","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42146","text":"3. "},{"id":"spn-42147","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement TrustSupervisor"},{"id":"spn-42148","text":" — DynamicSupervisor managing TrustWorkers"}]},{"id":"blk-38512","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-42149","text":"Phase 3: Search (weeks 6-10)"}]},{"id":"blk-38513","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42150","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-42151","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement full-text search"},{"id":"spn-42152","text":" (section 8)"}]},{"id":"blk-38514","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38516","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42153","text":"ts_vector generated column on agents (name A, description B, tags C)"}]}],"id":"blk-38515","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38518","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42154","text":"pg_trgm fuzzy matching indexes"}]}],"id":"blk-38517","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38520","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42155","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Search.search/2"},{"id":"spn-42156","text":" with filters: min_trust, category, runtime, limit"}]}],"id":"blk-38519","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38522","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42157","text":"Ranking: ts_rank descending, then trust_score descending"}]}],"id":"blk-38521","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-38523","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-42158","text":"Phase 4: Publish Pipeline (weeks 8-12)"}]},{"id":"blk-38524","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42159","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-42160","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement publish flow"},{"id":"spn-42161","text":" (section 6)"}]},{"id":"blk-38525","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38527","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42162","text":"Manifest validation → spec validation → duplicate check → trust computation → index update → audit + notify"}]}],"id":"blk-38526","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38529","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42163","text":"Version immutability enforcement"}]}],"id":"blk-38528","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38531","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42164","text":"Yank support (hides from search, preserves record)"}]}],"id":"blk-38530","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-38532","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42165","text":"2. "},{"id":"spn-42166","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement AuditWriter"},{"id":"spn-42167","text":" — Broadway pipeline for batched audit writes 3. "},{"id":"spn-42168","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement WebhookDispatcher"},{"id":"spn-42169","text":" — Oban worker for async webhook delivery with retry/backoff"}]},{"id":"blk-38533","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-42170","text":"Phase 5: Install Pipeline (weeks 10-14)"}]},{"id":"blk-38534","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42171","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-42172","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement install flow"},{"id":"spn-42173","text":" (section 7)"}]},{"id":"blk-38535","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38537","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42174","text":"Permission review → Delegatic policy check → MCP dependency resolution → OpenSentience deploy → Graphonomous connect → audit + confirm"}]}],"id":"blk-38536","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-38538","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42175","text":"2. "},{"id":"spn-42176","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement InstallEngine"},{"id":"spn-42177","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-42178","marks":["code"],"text":"install_engine.ex"},{"id":"spn-42179","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-38539","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38541","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42180","text":"Permission sandboxing (section 7.2)"}]}],"id":"blk-38540","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38543","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42181","text":"Delegatic org-level denylists"}]}],"id":"blk-38542","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-38544","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42182","text":"3. "},{"id":"spn-42183","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement Fork System"},{"id":"spn-42184","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-42185","marks":["code"],"text":"forks.ex"},{"id":"spn-42186","text":") — section 9"}]},{"id":"blk-38545","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38547","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42187","text":"Fork creates new agent under forker's account"}]}],"id":"blk-38546","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38549","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42188","marks":["code"],"text":"forked_from"},{"id":"spn-42189","text":" provenance tracking"}]}],"id":"blk-38548","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38551","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42190","text":"Trust score starts at 0 for forks"}]}],"id":"blk-38550","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-38552","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-42191","text":"Phase 6: Dark Factory Pipeline Intake (weeks 12-16)"}]},{"id":"blk-38553","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42192","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-42193","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement PipelineIntake"},{"id":"spn-42194","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-42195","marks":["code"],"text":"pipeline_intake.ex"},{"id":"spn-42196","text":") — section 10.2"}]},{"id":"blk-38554","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38556","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42197","text":"Accept "},{"id":"spn-42198","marks":["code"],"text":"ConsolidationEvent"},{"id":"spn-42199","text":" from Agentelic at "},{"id":"spn-42200","marks":["code"],"text":"POST /api/pipeline/intake"}]}],"id":"blk-38555","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38558","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42201","text":"Event validation: CloudEvents envelope, workspace_id, artifact_hash"}]}],"id":"blk-38557","kind":"list-